5225       options nosyntaxcheck obs=max firstobs=1 nodate nonumber nocenter linesize=160 pagesize=max nostimer nofullstimer validvarname=v7
5225     ! validmemname=compatible locale=en_US;
5226       %let syscc=0;
5227       title; footnote;
5228       ods _all_ close;
5229       ods listing gpath="%sysfunc(pathname(work))";
5230       ods graphics off;
5231       proc datasets library=work kill nolist;
NOTE: Deleting WORK.REGSTRY (memtype=ITEMSTOR).
NOTE: File WORK.REGSTRY (memtype=ITEMSTOR) cannot be deleted because it is in use.
NOTE: Deleting WORK.SASGOPT (memtype=CATALOG).
